190 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Equity, diversity & inclusion \(EDI\) is a strategic initiative at Bow Valley College. To support this important initiative, the EDI working group was formed. The EDI working group was tasked with creating and exploring recommendations for the College around inclusive communication that promotes a sense of belonging and trust. )
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
191 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (This complements the EDI Guiding Principles document developed by the EDI working group. It is intended to inspire Bow Valley College employees to be mindful about the impact of our language choices, aim to avoid offense, and strive to use language as a tool to include all populations. Please note that the following are only a few examples of an immense universe of inclusive language alternatives. Language is in constant flux; both vocabulary and phrases are fluid, changeable and evolve with time. )
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
192 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The EDI Working Group has consulted with members of diverse and traditionally excluded groups to ask for their voluntary participation and feedback on the contents of this document. We welcome suggestions and feedback from the College community. Please reach out to the EDI Working Group with comments or suggestions at communications@bowvalleycollege.ca.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
