/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Do not assume all persons of a specific race, ethnicity or region observe a particular religion. For instance, different Indigenous nations have their own religious institutions and sacred practices. Do not assume all persons of a specific religion practice the same way as culture has impacts on how religion is observed. Make attempts to speak to a particular sect of a religious group to avoid generalizations. Understanding nuances conveys sensitivity and respect. )
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
