<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Avoid assuming that everybody celebrates the same religious holidays that the dominant group celebrates. Avoid offending non-Christians and non-believers. Do not capitalize atheist or agnostic. Nonreligious has no hyphen. Ensure communication addresses a sensitivity to religious requirements \(e.g., wearing of masks by persons with facial hair, hijab, head scarves, turbans\).)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [2]
>>
